OL,3,GNEWSAMurder arrest after man, 78, found
OL,4,Adead at home
OL,5,
OL,6,FA man has been arrested on suspicion of
OL,7,Fmurder after a 78-year-old was found
OL,8,Fdead in his home following a suspected
OL,9,Fburglary, police have said.
OL,11,FGraham Bottomley was discovered at his
OL,12,Fhouse in Whitstable Close, Chadderton,
OL,13,Fafter Greater Manchester Police (GMP)
OL,14,Fsearched the property while
OL,15,Finvestigating a series of aggravated
OL,16,Fburglaries across Oldham.
OL,18,FThe force said it was "still
OL,19,Finvestigating these crimes" and has
OL,20,Fappealed to the public for any
OL,21,Finformation.
OL,23,APub: 10-NovQppppppppppppppppppppppG1/2
OL,24,ANext PageB NW Eng NewsC Reg TVF Weather
FL,409,400,260,160,0,100
