OL,3,GNEWSAMurder arrest after man, 78, found
OL,4,Adead at home
OL,5,
OL,6,FMr Bottomley's family said they were
OL,7,F"absolutely heartbroken following the
OL,8,Fsudden death of our beloved dad" and
OL,9,Fadded: "We are devastated and still
OL,10,Ftrying to come to terms with what has
OL,11,Fhappened."
